  "title": "Dysprosium Clusters from 3-Ethoxysalicylidene Terminal-Decorated Acylhydrazone Ligands: In Situ Ligand Transformation-Assisted Assembly and Zero-Field Single-Molecule Magnet Behaviors",
  "doi": "10.1021/acs.cgd.3c00169",
