      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Zero-field SMM with slow magnetization relaxation but no well-defined χ″ maxima; estimated Ueff = 1.9 K. Room-temperature χMT = 88.1 cm3 K mol−1 (theory 85.02 for six isolated DyIII); χMT decreases to 67.65 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K. Magnetization reaches 35.55 Nβ at 70 kOe, below the 60 Nβ theoretical saturation, consistent with magnetic anisotropy.",
